{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1345620-anyone-seen-a-celestial-monkey-around-here","id":1345620,"title":"Anyone seen a Celestial Monkey around here??","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-03T12:27:17-08:00","id":1345620,"title":"Anyone seen a Celestial Monkey around here??","content":"Hi forum<br /> <br /> So I have this player who would like to play a monkey style martial artist/ nature ninja solar night caste.<br /> <br /> <br /> So my question is: Does any body know of a good fanmade Monkey Style (with charms) or a good conversion of Celestial Monkey style?<br /> <br /> <br /> Now I have seen there is an old thread from 2015 about, but I don't want to necro it out of the blue. I don't have enough flair to seen if it is any good.<br /> <br /> Appreciate any help.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/854-light-hero","name":"light-hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-03T13:03:03-08:00","id":1345632,"title":"","content":"I would maybe suggest using Falcon Style with monkey-like stunts (as it favors climbing up things and acrobatic maneuvers as well as grappling) until Many-Faced Strangers, the Lunar supplement, comes out, since it includes Monkey Style along with Toad, Bear, Rat and Thousand Blades styles. That said I'm not aware of any homebrew ones existing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23684-alistair","name":"Alistair","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core